---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support | The Antique Archive"
  description="Support the preservation and growth of The Antique Archive collection. Patronage, partnerships, and co-acquisition opportunities for collectors and institutions."
>
  <section class="relative py-16 min-h-screen">

    <div class="container-narrow relative max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent mb-3">
        // Patronage
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl text-text mb-8">Support the Collection</h1>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="glass-panel p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            These objects survive not because they're old—but because someone chose to preserve them, catalog them, make them discoverable. If you believe this work matters, there are ways to participate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-4">// Why It Matters</h2>

          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Hong Kong has a rich tradition of private collectors preserving cultural heritage. From the Chih Lo Lou Collection at the Museum of Art to Peter Fung's Liang Yi Museum, individuals have safeguarded treasures that might otherwise be scattered or lost.
          </p>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            The Antique Archive continues this tradition with a focus on ancient coinage, Mesopotamian seals, and objects of personal adornment—material culture that connects us to daily life across millennia.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-4">// Ways to Participate</h2>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-accent font-mono">›</span>
              <span class="text-text">
                <strong class="text-text">Co-Acquisition</strong>
                <span class="text-text-muted"> — Partner on significant acquisitions. Share ownership or sponsor pieces that join the archive with attribution.</span>
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-accent font-mono">›</span>
              <span class="text-text">
                <strong class="text-text">Collection Sponsorship</strong>
                <span class="text-text-muted"> — Support ongoing preservation, photography, research, and digital cataloging efforts.</span>
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-accent font-mono">›</span>
              <span class="text-text">
                <strong class="text-text">Institutional Partnership</strong>
                <span class="text-text-muted"> — Museums, universities, and cultural foundations interested in loans, exhibitions, or research collaboration.</span>
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-accent font-mono">›</span>
              <span class="text-text">
                <strong class="text-text">Advisory Circle</strong>
                <span class="text-text-muted"> — Experienced collectors who wish to share expertise, suggest acquisitions, or connect with fellow enthusiasts.</span>
              </span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-4">// What Support Enables</h2>

          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-mono">01</span>
              <span class="text-text-muted">Acquisition of significant pieces before they disappear into private hands</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-mono">02</span>
              <span class="text-text-muted">Professional conservation and high-resolution documentation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-mono">03</span>
              <span class="text-text-muted">Research publications and educational content</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-mono">04</span>
              <span class="text-text-muted">Physical exhibition space in Hong Kong (long-term goal)</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-4">// Get in Touch</h2>

          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            All inquiries are welcome—whether you're a fellow collector, represent an institution, or simply want to learn more about supporting the archive.
          </p>

          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Telegram:{' '}
            <a href="https://t.me/ccccoooocccc" class="text-accent hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
              @ccccoooocccc
            </a>
            <br />
            <span class="text-text-dim">Hong Kong Based</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
